body.sv:
Compose reaches this file through `build: .` in `compose.yaml` (shown as the source of this step). The image:

1. starts from `python:3.12-slim`;
2. sets `/app` as the working directory;
3. installs `debugpy`, with no version pinned;
4. copies the local `service` folder to `/app/service`.

The source is **copied at build time, not mounted**. The code running in the container is the code from the last build, which is why the task rebuilds on every F5.

There is no `CMD`. What runs is decided by `command` in `compose.yaml`, in the next step.

